    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for work again. I did not claim it.\n\nFacts on upstream/main:\n- `Rotor.STEP` is not attached to this issue. It is not in the tree.\n- The nearest fixture is `testdata/models/twisted_flank.step` (6,984 bytes). Its tests (`crates/geometry/tests/step_twisted_flank.rs`) import it quickly. It does not show the slow path.\n- No commit refers to this issue.\n\nWithout the file, a worker cannot write a pinning test that fails. Thus I stopped before the claim.\n\nRequest (same as the comment above): attach `Rotor.STEP`, or a smaller file that shows the same slow import. Until then, this issue needs a profile, not a code fix. Suggest `blocked` or `needs-research`. The maintainer decides.\n",
